            ["Content"] = "算了算了，这次的情况就算你擅长解码也没用。全要塞的机关都被同盟改装过了，根本没时间挨个破解完。",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Laisse tomber. Même si t’avais excellé, ça ne servirait à rien ici. Les Déchus ont déjà modifié tous les dispositifs de défense. On n’a pas le temps de les déchiffrer un par un.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011312,
            ["FacialId"] = {
                [1] = "110010:None",
                },
            ["GUID"] = "1B90CF60",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011313,
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 110010,
            ["TalkActionId"] = {
                [1] = "110010:Confident_End",
                [2] = "110022:Talk01_End",
                },
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90CF60",
            },
        [11011313] = {
            ["Camera"] = "762.444336,-451.796875,86.761429,0.00037,1.745735,147.234253,35.000011,100000.0,false,Manual,22.0",
            ["Content"] = "不过，“先解决机关”的判断是正确的，我们接下来要去的就是<H>动力室</>。",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Cela dit, t’avais raison, il faut d’abord neutraliser ces systèmes. Notre prochaine destination est la <H>salle des machines</>.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011313,
            ["FinalCamera"] = "728.643555,-504.324219,86.761093,0.00037,1.745735,147.234253,35.000011,100000.0,false,Manual,22.0",
            ["GUID"] = "1B90CF8A",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011314,
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 110010,
            ["TalkActionId"] = {
                [1] = "110010:Talk02_Start",
                },
            ["ToFinalCameraBlendTime"] = 15,
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90CF8A",
            },
        [11011314] = {
            ["Content"] = "强制切断动力、关停机关后，救援其他受困士兵——这就是接下来的作战目标。",
            ["ContentFR"] = "En forçant la coupure d’énergie, nous désactiverons les mécanismes, ce qui donnera une chance de dégager nos soldats prisonniers. Voilà notre objectif immédiat.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011314,
            ["Duration"] = 3,
            ["GUID"] = "1B90CF8B",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011315,
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 110010,
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90CF8B",
            },
        [11011315] = {
            ["Content"] = "那边的装置至少需要两个人协力，亏得我先把你捞出来了。",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Là-bas, certains dispositifs nécessitent l’action de deux personnes... heureusement que je t’ai {性别2:récupéré|récupérée}.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011315,
            ["GUID"] = "1B90CFDE",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011316,
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 110010,
            ["TalkActionId"] = {
                [1] = "110010:Talk02_End",
                },
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90CFDE",
            },
        [11011316] = {
            ["Camera"] = "112.263672,-51.882812,144.46846,0.000339,3.600268,98.398293,35.000015,183.304688,false,Manual,22.0",
            ["Content"] = "等等，有人联络……",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Attends... on nous contacte.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011316,
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D008",
            ["LookAt"] = {
                [1] = "110010:n(110010)",
                },
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011317,
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 110010,
            ["TalkActionId"] = {
                [1] = "110010:Call_Start",
                },
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D008",
            },
        [11011317] = {
            ["Camera"] = "140.575195,-95.742188,175.792465,0.00006,-8.19863,103.384193,35.000008,100000.0,false,Manual,22.0",
            ["Content"] = "喂？喂喂？听到了吗？<H>海伯利亚今日天气怎么样？</>",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Allô ? Vous me recevez ? <H>Quel temps fait-il aujourd’hui en Hyperborea ?</>",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011317,
            ["DialoguePanelType"] = "{type:Guide;style:Communicator}",
            ["FinalCamera"] = "-5.985352,-65.789062,175.738083,0.00007,-8.398653,55.582458,35.000008,100000.0,false,Manual,22.0",
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D032",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011318,
            ["Scripts"] = "PlayNormalSound{EventPath{\"event:/sfx/common/story/ex01/signal_on\"},PlayAs2D{true}}",
            ["SnapShot"] = "TELEPHONE",
            ["SpeakNpcName"] = "UI_Npc_Voice",
            ["TalkActionId"] = {
                [1] = "110022:Talk02_End",
                },
            ["ToFinalCameraBlendTime"] = 50,
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D032",
            },
        [11011318] = {
            ["Content"] = "<H>迪斯玛尼亚今夜有雨。</>",
            ["ContentFR"] = "<H>Il pleut ce soir sur Dismania.</>",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011318,
            ["Duration"] = 1,
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D05C",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011319,
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 110010,
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D05C",
            },
        [11011319] = {
            ["Content"] = "阿瓦尔长官？是您吗？我是维克！",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Commandant Avar ? C’est vous ? Ici Vic !",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011319,
            ["DialoguePanelType"] = "{type:Guide;style:Communicator}",
            ["Duration"] = 1,
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D086",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011320,
            ["SnapShot"] = "TELEPHONE",
            ["SpeakNpcName"] = "UI_Npc_Voice",
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D086",
            },
        [11011320] = {
            ["Content"] = "是我，报告现状。",
            ["ContentFR"] = "C’est moi. Rapportez la situation.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011320,
            ["Duration"] = 1,
            ["FacialId"] = {
                [1] = "110010:Think01",
                },
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D0B0",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011321,
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 110010,
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D0B0",
            },
        [11011321] = {
            ["Content"] = "与您分开后，我和莫妮卡选择了外环路线，现在已经抵达动力室附近。",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Après la séparation, Monica et moi avons suivi le périmètre extérieur. Nous sommes arrivés près de la salle des machines.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011321,
            ["DialoguePanelType"] = "{type:Guide;style:Communicator}",
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D0DA",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011322,
            ["SnapShot"] = "TELEPHONE",
            ["SpeakNpcName"] = "UI_Npc_Weike",
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D0DA",
            },
        [11011322] = {
            ["Content"] = "动力室？你们莫非也打算——",
            ["ContentFR"] = "La salle des machines ? Vous comptez donc...",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011322,
            ["Duration"] = 1,
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D104",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011323,
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 110010,
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D104",
            },
        [11011323] = {
            ["Content"] = "我是来特地向您报告的，我们接下来会尝试关闭动力装置。",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Je voulais justement vous prévenir, nous allons tenter de couper l’alimentation.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011323,
            ["DialoguePanelType"] = "{type:Guide;style:Communicator}",
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D12E",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011324,
            ["SnapShot"] = "TELEPHONE",
            ["SpeakNpcName"] = "UI_Npc_Weike",
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D12E",
            },
        [11011324] = {
            ["Camera"] = "6.650391,45.976562,136.704086,0.000072,12.600298,22.184877,35.000008,112.428253,false,Manual,22.0",
            ["Content"] = "先别急，动力室很可能有陷阱。你们两个原地待命，我们再有十几分钟就能赶过去帮你们了。",
            ["ContentFR"] = "N’en faites rien ! Il y a sûrement des pièges. Restez où vous êtes, {nickname2} et moi serons sur place dans une quinzaine de minutes.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011324,
            ["ExStoryInfo"] = "EXPlayer",
            ["FinalCamera"] = "5.854492,47.929688,136.704086,0.000072,12.600298,22.184877,35.000008,112.428253,false,Manual,22.0",
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D158",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011325,
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 110010,
            ["ToFinalCameraBlendTime"] = 20,
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D158",
            },
        [11011325] = {
            ["Content"] = "先让我们试试吧，长官！多耽误一分钟，其他人就多一分钟危险。",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Permettez-nous d’essayer, mon commandant ! Chaque minute perdue met nos camarades en plus grand danger.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011325,
            ["DialoguePanelType"] = "{type:Guide;style:Communicator}",
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D182",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011326,
            ["SnapShot"] = "TELEPHONE",
            ["SpeakNpcName"] = "UI_Npc_Weike",
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D182",
            },
        [11011326] = {
            ["Camera"] = "59.295898,61.582031,155.348526,0.000335,-4.601198,-74.576843,35.0,178.050125,false,Manual,22.0",
            ["Content"] = "你小子……",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Toi...",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011326,
            ["FacialId"] = {
                [1] = "110022:Doubt01",
                },
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D1AC",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011327,
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 110010,
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D1AC",
            },
        [11011327] = {
            ["Camera"] = "-1.773438,-172.789062,140.002975,0.000304,-0.201839,60.417431,35.000008,178.050125,false,Manual,22.0",
            ["Content"] = "还有最后一件事……既然{nickname2}在您那的话，能不能告诉我“狮鹫”分队的情况怎么样？我弟弟西蒙他……",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Encore une chose. Puisque {nickname2} est avec vous... pouvez-vous me dire ce qu’il en est des Griffons ? Mon frère Simon... il en fait partie.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011327,
            ["DialoguePanelType"] = "{type:Guide;style:Communicator}",
            ["ExStoryInfo"] = "EXPlayer",
            ["FacialId"] = {
                [1] = "110022:None",
                },
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D1D6",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011328,
            ["SnapShot"] = "TELEPHONE",
            ["SpeakNpcName"] = "UI_Npc_Weike",
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D1D6",
            },
        [11011328] = {
            ["Content"] = "…………",
            ["ContentFR"] = "...",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011328,
            ["Duration"] = 2,
            ["ExStoryInfo"] = "EXPlayer",
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D200",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011329,
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 110022,
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D200",
            },
        [11011329] = {
            ["Camera"] = "11.716797,206.703125,167.242294,0.000336,-6.80127,-68.977051,35.000011,178.050125,false,Manual,22.0",
            ["Content"] = "我目前没有发现他的尸体。",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Je n’ai pas retrouvé son corps.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011329,
            ["ExStoryInfo"] = "EXPlayer",
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D22A",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011330,
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 110022,
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D22A",
            },
        [11011330] = {
            ["Content"] = "……啊……？",
            ["ContentFR"] = "... Hein ?",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011330,
            ["DialoguePanelType"] = "{type:Guide;style:Communicator}",
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D254",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011331,
            ["SnapShot"] = "TELEPHONE",
            ["SpeakNpcName"] = "UI_Npc_Weike",
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D254",
            },
        [11011331] = {
            ["Camera"] = "6.71582,-172.675781,139.699112,0.000306,0.19813,66.419029,35.000015,178.050125,false,Manual,22.0",
            ["Content"] = "咳，没事，没事。他受了些伤，在休整点躺着。医务员看着呢，别担心。",
            ["ContentFR"] = "<I>Hum.</> Ce {性别2:qu’il|qu’elle} veut dire, c’est que Simon est blessé, mais vivant. Il se repose à un poste de secours, sous la surveillance des médecins. Ne vous inquiétez pas.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011331,
            ["FacialId"] = {
                [1] = "110010:Unhappy01",
                },
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D27E",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011332,
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 110010,
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D27E",
            },
        [11011332] = {
            ["Content"] = "……明白了，多谢。",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Je comprends. Merci, mon commandant.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011332,
            ["DialoguePanelType"] = "{type:Guide;style:Communicator}",
            ["Duration"] = 2,
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D2A8",
            ["NextDialogue"] = 11011333,
            ["Scripts"] = "PARA{\
PlayNormalSound{_delay{3.5},EventPath{\"event:/sfx/common/story/ex01/signal_off\"},PlayAs2D{true}},\
PlayAnimation{_delay{3.5},ActorId{110010},AnimationId{\"Call_End\"},Duration{1}}\
}",
            ["SnapShot"] = "TELEPHONE",
            ["SpeakNpcName"] = "UI_Npc_Weike",
            ["VoiceName"] = "voice/$Locale$/story/1002/110113/1B90D2A8",
            },
        [11011333] = {
            ["Content"] = "你那张嘴，以后还是别安慰人了，千万别。",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Sérieusement... {nickname2}, ne cherche jamais à réconforter qui que ce soit. Plus jamais.",
            ["DialogueId"] = 11011333,
            ["FacialId"] = {
                [1] = "110010:Syouganai01",
                },
            ["GUID"] = "1B90D2D2",
            ["LookAt"] = {
