            ["Content"] = "既然是百年春烦恼的事情，就交给我们来帮忙解决吧！狩月人的售后服务，包老板满意！",
            ["ContentFR"] = "Puisque ça cause des soucis à Éternel Printemps, on va s’en occuper ! Le service après-vente des Chasseurs de Phoxène : satisfaction garantie pour le client !",
            ["DialogueId"] = 51151048,
            ["GUID"] = "800D20D0",
            ["SpeakNpcId"] = 200002,
            ["TalkActionId"] = {
                [1] = "100001:AgreeHead",
                },
            },
        [51151049] = {
            ["Camera"] = "595.386719,637.626953,151.045898,0.000026,-1.464959,-133.471008,35.0,100000.0,false,DoNotOverride,22.0",
            ["Content"] = "我们白天路过的房子是这间吗？",
